  {
    "title": "The Brand Identity – Home of the Greatest in Brand & Design",
    "link": "https://the-brandidentity.com/project/offball-and-alright-studio-team-up-to-rethink-what-a-sports-news-platform-can-look-and-feel-like",
    "pubDate": "Mon, 11 May 2026 01:01:17 GMT",
    "content": "From the team with experience building media companies like Sports Illustrated, The Players’ Tribune, PUCK, Airmail, and Togethxr comes OffBall, a sports world news site that shifts focus from the game to the rich cultural tapestry surrounding it. Unlike traditional sports coverage that focuses on game statistics and match results, where sensationalism often takes centre stage, this digital-first platform strives to reframe public perception of sport and athletes in nuanced ways.",
